  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic sludge pools of the Bone Dry district, 'Chrome Dome' scavenged for scraps amongst the skeletal remains of Subchain City. He always dreamed of bigger hauls and a more glamorous beakwear than the ubiquitous Scabbed model, so he joined a raiding flock to make his fortune.",
    "class": "Junker Tech",
    "name": "Chrome Dome",
    "personality": "Resourceful: Chrome Dome can fix almost anything with a wrench and some duct tape, making him invaluable on raids. Cynical: He trusts no one and expects the worst, a survival mechanism honed from years of scraping by. Flashy: Despite his grimy exterior, Chrome Dome craves attention, customizing his gear with any shiny objects he can find.",
